Check eligibility from r_accounts. All of these must hold:
(1) at least one personal checking account (account_type checking) with status OPEN;
(2) the new account will not take the customer above 6 business checking accounts;
(3) no account has status CLOSED;
(4) the existing personal checking account's balance is at least $500.
If any check fails, tell the customer which requirement is not met, do not open the account, and stop this job.
